{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41515","headline":"和人赠沈彬 · 廖匡图","name":"和人赠沈彬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冥鸿迹在烟霞上，燕雀休夸大厦巢。\n名利最爲浮世重，古今能有几人抛。\n逼真但使心无着，混俗何妨手强抄。\n深喜卜居连岳色，水边竹下得论交。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖匡图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}